\end{align*}

##### Constraints

1. **Demand satisfaction (each outlet receives at least its demand):**
   $$
   \sum_{i \in I} x_{ij} \geq d_j \quad \forall j \in J
   $$
   Explicitly:
   \begin{align*}
   x_{S1,C1} + x_{S2,C1} + x_{S3,C1} + x_{S4,C1} &\geq 94 \\
   x_{S1,C2} + x_{S2,C2} + x_{S3,C2} + x_{S4,C2} &\geq 39 \\
